    "long_instructions": "# Brand Analysis\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. Compare each pair of websites shown here.\r\n2. In the boxes below each brand, record what you notice about color, topography, layout, and overall tone.\r\n3. Then explain who each brand seems to target.\r\n   -   Use specific evidence from the design (colors, fonts, imagry, layout) to support your thinking about the intended audience.",
