            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "The Adidas brand ...\n- Bright, energetic colors (yellow and red).\n- Urban, sporty look with focus on pop culture events like FIFA.\n- Bold text and sharp graphic design. ",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "The Adidas brand ...\n- Bright, energetic colors (yellow and red).\n- Urban, sporty look with focus on pop culture events like FIFA.\n- Bold text and sharp graphic design. ",
