            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "It seems like Nike's target audience is \nTeens and young adults who are into sports and \ncompetition. The dark colors and intense athlete\n images make it feel serious and powerful.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "It seems like Nike's target audience is \nTeens and young adults who are into sports and \ncompetition. The dark colors and intense athlete\n images make it feel serious and powerful.",
